          "title_zh": "导航信息嵌入：利用智能体搜索轨迹自适应稠密检索器",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.15956v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2608.15956",
          "summary": "Navigation-Informed Embeddings (NIE) adapts a deployed dense retriever using query, retrieval, and stopping traces produced by agentic search, without new relevance labels, synthetic queries, or LLM judgments. A BGE encoder adapted with NIE improves Recall@20 on an independent target benchmark from 72.2 to 78.0 overall, and long-path performance from 46.7 to 55.4.",
