          "summary": "SEER learns to scan query-relevant rendered text images and retrieve textual content only where needed, combining the efficiency of visual compression with the precision of text-based reasoning. On LongBench it reaches 51.11% average accuracy, outperforming the Glyph-9B visual-text baseline by 2.33 points and Qwen3-8B by 3.49 points while retaining average prompt-token savings.",
